{"3235530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "虚衝 - Kyosho", "steam_appid": 3235530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A one-hit kill game that embodies tension and a sense of relief.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As you slash away at the waves of defeated warriors, use your inventory to solve puzzles and uncover the secrets of the samurai mansion.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this cursed mansion in dire straits, can you survive and uncover the truth?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235530/extras/0bb605cc3e198911332608a1bfc27c0c.poster.avif?t=1771380245\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235530/extras/0bb605cc3e198911332608a1bfc27c0c.webm?t=1771380245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235530/extras/0bb605cc3e198911332608a1bfc27c0c.mp4?t=1771380245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A Puzzle Adventure Like No Other</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unique blend of puzzle-solving and horror, every item you collect transforms into a polyomino-shaped piece. Use these pieces creatively: solve intricate puzzles, craft tools, unlock paths, or even sacrifice them in moments of desperation. Adapt your strategy and make the most of your inventory—how you survive is entirely up to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235530/extras/6b84b74bee68f5f09386a1fdf5897523.poster.avif?t=1771380245\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://sha