 via the email address listed on the Mutsu Mutsu Project official website.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please include the name of the game, &quot;虚衝 - Kyosho&quot; or &quot;Kyosho&quot; in the title field of your video post or live stream.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please include the Steam store page URL in the summary or description field of your video post or live stream.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization is only possible if you use the monetization methods provided by the designated video sharing site (*1) (ad revenue, super chat, tips, donations, etc.). Monetization in other cases is prohibited.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutsu'pro(むつむつプロジェクト) is not responsible for any damage or trouble that occurs during video post or live stream.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The following content is prohibited from being posted.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anything that violates public order and morals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >anything that includes religious solicitation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >anything that significantly damages the value of the game</p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These guidelines are subject to change without notice.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*1: Designated video sharing sites (Youtube, Niconico, Twitch, TwitCasting, TikTok)</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A one-hit kill game that embodies tension and a sense of relief.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As you slash away at the waves of defeated warriors, use your inventory to solve puzzles and uncover the secrets of the samurai mansion.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this cursed mansion in dire straits, can you survive and uncover the truth?</strong></p><p clas